WEBVTT

00:01:47.119 --> 00:01:49.815
Let's go this way, Uncle!

00:01:50.556 --> 00:01:53.286
Uncle! Come on, quickly!

00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:44.610
It looked like an ordinary meteor.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.812
Captain, we must stay alert.

00:02:46.812 --> 00:02:48.881
That's an order from planet Jurai.

00:02:48.881 --> 00:02:50.508
Yes, Sir.

00:03:02.995 --> 00:03:05.190
Follow me, everyone.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.930
Quiet. Behave yourself, koala bear.

00:03:12.538 --> 00:03:13.739
I don't wanna do this.

00:03:13.739 --> 00:03:15.608
What's the matter? You look fine.

00:03:15.608 --> 00:03:18.099
- I don't like it!
- Come on, already!

00:03:19.679 --> 00:03:22.477
Hello! We're sorry for being late!

00:03:23.082 --> 00:03:25.151
Is everybody here, then?

00:03:25.151 --> 00:03:27.653
Okay. Let's get going.

00:03:27.653 --> 00:03:30.349
I can't believe I'm doing this.

00:03:34.026 --> 00:03:36.829
The airport sure is heavily guarded.

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:41.434
I heard that Princess Ayeka and her
accomplices are trying to get to planet Jurai.

00:03:41.434 --> 00:03:43.002
Oh, my! Really?!

00:03:43.002 --> 00:03:44.804
Yeah, that's what they're saying.

00:03:44.804 --> 00:03:47.273
- Oh! I'm scared!
- Oh! I'm scared!

00:03:47.273 --> 00:03:49.542
Come on, you girls. Keep moving.

00:03:49.542 --> 00:03:52.945
How would you like to
have a drink with me later?

00:03:52.945 --> 00:03:56.437
Oh, my! You are such a flirt, Mr. Driver.

00:03:57.983 --> 00:04:00.052
What should we do when we get there?

00:04:00.052 --> 00:04:02.714
I wanna eat something delicious.

00:04:03.255 --> 00:04:05.458
I'm so embarrassed.

00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:08.561
Everyone, come this way, please.

00:04:08.561 --> 00:04:10.896
A school trip from the planet Yebisu, huh?

00:04:10.896 --> 00:04:13.232
That's right!

00:04:13.232 --> 00:04:15.901
Seems like an awfully small group, doesn't it?

00:04:15.901 --> 00:04:17.636
Well, it's a very small school.

00:04:17.636 --> 00:04:19.638
Ah! You! Miss! Hey, hey, hey!

00:04:19.638 --> 00:04:20.639
Me?

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:21.640
What are you?

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.642
I'm a Galaxy Police officer!

00:04:23.642 --> 00:04:24.543
What?

00:04:24.543 --> 00:04:27.346
Doctor, there you are!

00:04:27.346 --> 00:04:29.148
You're a doctor, remember?

00:04:29.148 --> 00:04:30.716
Huh?

00:04:30.716 --> 00:04:35.654
Ah! A doctor! I am a doctor
at the clinic on campus!

00:04:35.654 --> 00:04:37.323
All right, then.

00:04:37.323 --> 00:04:39.658
Everything's in order, Ma'am.
You may move along.

00:04:39.658 --> 00:04:42.354
Thank you very much!

00:04:49.602 --> 00:04:53.163
I need to inspect your ship.
It's a standard practice.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:17.925
I'm... at... block... 13C.
Nothing... to... report.

00:05:39.318 --> 00:05:42.621
This scanner is state-of-the-art.

00:05:42.621 --> 00:05:45.391
Are you sure we won't get caught?

00:05:45.391 --> 00:05:46.759
Don't worry.

00:05:46.759 --> 00:05:51.560
When they scan our clothes all they'll
see is fake DNA and skeleton data.

00:05:55.534 --> 00:05:58.537
The contact lenses we're
wearing have fake retinas.

00:05:58.537 --> 00:06:00.639
We have perfect fake I.D.'s.

00:06:00.639 --> 00:06:04.243
I'm utterly fantastic.
I'm such a genius, aren't I?

00:06:04.243 --> 00:06:06.211
Wow!

00:06:45.618 --> 00:06:47.086
Everything looks okay.

00:06:47.086 --> 00:06:50.990
But did you know your
frame is very masculine?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.994
Uh-Uh, I... have a father who's a man.

00:06:54.994 --> 00:06:58.898
Now, how can you be so
rude to such a pretty lady?

00:06:58.898 --> 00:07:01.196
Come on. We can go.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.836
- What?!
- Oh! Excuse me!

00:07:03.836 --> 00:07:07.795
My name is Sagami. I'm traveling by myself.

00:07:09.475 --> 00:07:11.477
Oh, I didn't catch your name.

00:07:11.477 --> 00:07:13.245
My name?

00:07:13.245 --> 00:07:17.616
My name is, ah, um... T-T-Tenko.

00:07:17.616 --> 00:07:20.185
Ah, Tenko, huh? What a pretty name.

00:07:20.185 --> 00:07:23.489
You know, you sort of
remind me of my mother.

00:07:23.489 --> 00:07:26.058
Oh, Tenko!

00:07:26.058 --> 00:07:27.726
Looks like you're popular.

00:07:27.726 --> 00:07:30.796
Well, now, your name's Sagami?

00:07:30.796 --> 00:07:34.133
These students are
my responsibility, you know.

00:07:34.133 --> 00:07:37.536
So keep it a friendship, okay?

00:07:37.536 --> 00:07:39.504
Why, certainly, Sir!

00:07:40.906 --> 00:07:42.533
This guy's good.

00:07:45.477 --> 00:07:47.880
See you later!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.481
Hey, move quickly!

00:07:49.481 --> 00:07:51.346
Ah... okay.

00:07:57.022 --> 00:07:58.924
Hey, what's wrong?

00:07:58.924 --> 00:08:00.359
What have you got there?!

00:08:00.359 --> 00:08:03.429
- Nothing, really.
- Just empty your pockets!

00:08:03.429 --> 00:08:04.997
Yeah, okay.

00:08:04.997 --> 00:08:07.733
I mean, I can't think of anything
that wouldn't pass a security check.

00:08:07.733 --> 00:08:11.670
This can't be it. This is nothing dangerous.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.872
That's a Galaxy Police blaster!

00:08:13.872 --> 00:08:15.741
Or is this the problem? Or is this?

00:08:15.741 --> 00:08:17.543
Could this be it?

00:08:17.543 --> 00:08:20.603
Oh, I don't know!

00:08:22.581 --> 00:08:26.552
Now all we have to do is get an
entry permit and then smooth sailing.

00:08:26.552 --> 00:08:28.543
No problem.

00:08:31.824 --> 00:08:34.759
That is a fabulous ship, isn't it?

00:08:37.863 --> 00:08:39.198
What now?

00:08:39.198 --> 00:08:41.462
- This doesn't look good.
- We'd better get going!

00:08:43.102 --> 00:08:44.136
What are we going to do?!

00:08:44.136 --> 00:08:46.438
We've gotta get back to Yagami.

00:08:46.438 --> 00:08:49.168
If they find out our
ship's true identity, it's over!

00:08:53.145 --> 00:08:55.381
Well, it looks as if we've found them.

00:08:55.381 --> 00:08:58.317
An inspection officer
has located one for sure.

00:08:58.317 --> 00:09:01.220
Switch the security system to mode A.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.622
Seems we're having trouble
with the security system.

00:09:03.622 --> 00:09:05.224
It's not fully functional.

00:09:05.224 --> 00:09:08.994
What do you mean?! That's impossible!
Switch over to the backup system!

00:09:08.994 --> 00:09:11.462
We're trying to switch to the backup system!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.969
Where is he? Where did Tenchi go?

00:09:16.969 --> 00:09:19.631
Help me!

00:09:20.372 --> 00:09:22.499
Ryoko!

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:27.012
What are you doing?! Get away from me!

00:09:27.012 --> 00:09:31.016
Ouch! Hey, Ryoko, don't you
remember you said we'd die together!

00:09:31.016 --> 00:09:32.851
You're crazy! I never said that!

00:09:32.851 --> 00:09:34.409
Did too!

00:09:36.955 --> 00:09:39.725
Ah, this is great.

00:09:39.725 --> 00:09:43.126
I'm a lucky guy to have tea
with two beautiful girls like you.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.866
Make yourselves comfortable and sit down.

00:09:47.866 --> 00:09:54.073
Airport food doesn't usually suit my
tastes, but this cafeteria is an exception.

00:09:54.073 --> 00:09:55.574
The food here is quite good.

00:09:55.574 --> 00:09:57.743
I think I'd like to have some juice.

00:09:57.743 --> 00:09:59.778
I'll take a <i>café au lait.</i>

00:09:59.778 --> 00:10:01.712
As you wish, Mademoiselles.

00:10:11.356 --> 00:10:12.846
Stop!

00:10:14.193 --> 00:10:15.127
Ryoko!

00:10:15.127 --> 00:10:16.929
Tenchi! There you are!

00:10:16.929 --> 00:10:19.022
Mihoshi is coming, too.

00:10:20.966 --> 00:10:23.802
Hello there. My name's Tenko.

00:10:23.802 --> 00:10:25.537
Is there a problem, officer?

00:10:25.537 --> 00:10:27.368
They know who we are!

00:10:32.344 --> 00:10:34.812
Get out of our way!

00:10:43.355 --> 00:10:45.255
Ah, sorry about that.

00:11:05.144 --> 00:11:06.668
I'll get 'em!

00:11:33.305 --> 00:11:34.540
Yay!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.768
Come on! Hurry!

00:11:36.975 --> 00:11:39.068
Oh! Wait for me!

00:11:46.818 --> 00:11:49.488
Great. So which way do we go now?

00:11:49.488 --> 00:11:52.558
We... should... go... right.

00:11:52.558 --> 00:11:54.025
We should go left, then!

00:11:59.698 --> 00:12:03.429
The switch to the backup
system is almost complete.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.108
- Oh, no!
- Whoa!

00:12:10.108 --> 00:12:12.511
Tenchi, we're trapped!
Come and help us, Tenchi!

00:12:12.511 --> 00:12:14.746
It's got my leg! I can't get out!

00:12:14.746 --> 00:12:16.081
Sasami!

00:12:16.081 --> 00:12:17.849
Please let me go!

00:12:17.849 --> 00:12:19.318
Let me go!

00:12:19.318 --> 00:12:21.286
That's no use, Tenchi.

00:12:30.329 --> 00:12:31.597
Ryo-Ohki!

00:12:31.597 --> 00:12:34.900
You see?! I told you we
should have gone to the right!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.337
I'll give you a turn to the right!

00:12:38.337 --> 00:12:41.139
All right! I'm sorry! Okay!

00:12:41.139 --> 00:12:42.941
Stop that, you two!

00:12:42.941 --> 00:12:45.410
We have to get Sasami out!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.679
Tenchi!

00:12:47.679 --> 00:12:49.442
Ryoko!

00:13:17.876 --> 00:13:19.911
Hey, Uncle?

00:13:19.911 --> 00:13:22.080
Where are you?

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.014
Uncle...

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.387
Uncle!

00:13:32.791 --> 00:13:35.988
Uncle!

00:14:11.963 --> 00:14:16.332
Uncle... Uncle...

00:14:21.039 --> 00:14:23.803
Tenchi!

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:27.112
Tenchi!

00:14:27.112 --> 00:14:29.548
Ryoko!

00:14:29.548 --> 00:14:32.016
Ayeka!

00:14:33.285 --> 00:14:34.619
You heard that voice?

00:14:34.619 --> 00:14:36.348
Let's go check it out.

00:14:39.991 --> 00:14:42.118
Hey! Who's there?

00:14:43.895 --> 00:14:46.159
What the... Who are you?!

00:14:59.978 --> 00:15:01.747
Huh?

00:15:01.747 --> 00:15:02.948
Ah!

00:15:02.948 --> 00:15:05.678
Open the gates! Let me out of here!

00:15:28.607 --> 00:15:32.577
We've got one of them trapped in block 4.

00:15:32.577 --> 00:15:34.312
Good job.

00:15:34.312 --> 00:15:35.714
Where are you going?

00:15:35.714 --> 00:15:37.349
There must be somebody over there.

00:15:37.349 --> 00:15:39.840
I'll go and give them
instructions immediately.

00:15:47.559 --> 00:15:50.562
What? This is a dead end, too?!

00:15:50.562 --> 00:15:53.698
It's like a maze in here, isn't it?

00:15:53.698 --> 00:15:57.725
I hope the others are safe.

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.956
Around that corner, I think
that's where we came from.

00:16:17.956 --> 00:16:20.125
Sasami...

00:16:20.125 --> 00:16:21.854
Freeze! Right there!

00:16:23.028 --> 00:16:24.629
Damn!

00:16:24.629 --> 00:16:28.565
- Ryoko, I'm scared!
- Ah... get off me, will ya?!

00:16:29.634 --> 00:16:31.736
Don't grab me <i>there!</i>

00:16:31.736 --> 00:16:33.472
But Ryoko!

00:16:33.472 --> 00:16:35.407
Hold it right there!

00:16:35.407 --> 00:16:38.376
Why don't you pick on
someone your own size?

00:16:38.376 --> 00:16:40.078
Where are your manners?

00:16:40.078 --> 00:16:41.313
And just who are you?

00:16:41.313 --> 00:16:43.014
Sagami!

00:16:43.014 --> 00:16:47.018
I'm pleased you remember me..."Tenko."

00:16:47.018 --> 00:16:48.653
Here, catch!

00:16:48.653 --> 00:16:50.143
Thank you!

00:17:02.834 --> 00:17:05.928
Mihoshi, will you let go of me, already?!

00:17:12.611 --> 00:17:14.101
The game's over!

00:17:17.816 --> 00:17:19.147
There.

00:17:21.319 --> 00:17:23.355
Sagami? Where'd Sagami go?

00:17:23.355 --> 00:17:26.157
Stop it, stop it, stop it...

00:17:26.157 --> 00:17:29.024
Can't someone get her off me?!

00:17:47.345 --> 00:17:48.880
Sasami!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.871
Sasami!!

00:17:58.657 --> 00:18:00.784
Sasami!

00:18:07.065 --> 00:18:08.896
Sasami!

00:18:19.144 --> 00:18:21.704
Now would be a really
good time to get outta here.

00:18:23.081 --> 00:18:24.446
We're almost there!

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:31.790
Tenchi! Sasami! There you are!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:33.553
Ayeka!

00:18:42.467 --> 00:18:46.071
They must really believe
they can get away from us.

00:18:46.071 --> 00:18:47.561
Go ahead.

00:19:25.777 --> 00:19:27.267
Yagami!

00:19:31.082 --> 00:19:33.175
Okay, Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:49.034 --> 00:19:50.635
What?!

00:19:50.635 --> 00:19:53.805
There is no way this can be happening!

00:19:53.805 --> 00:19:55.602
No way...

00:20:14.526 --> 00:20:15.925
Uncle?

00:20:20.665 --> 00:20:23.395
Uncle has helped us escape.

00:20:30.575 --> 00:20:34.212
It looks like they've escaped successfully.

00:20:34.212 --> 00:20:36.247
I thank you for helping.

00:20:36.247 --> 00:20:39.884
I had fun doing it.

00:20:39.884 --> 00:20:43.154
Do you think they'll actually make it to Jurai?

00:20:43.154 --> 00:20:47.959
It's all up to the princess now.

00:20:47.959 --> 00:20:52.453
Oh, you have grown so much, Princess Sasami.

00:22:54.085 --> 00:22:58.857
A long time ago, there were two knights
who fought to protect the king of Jurai.

00:22:58.857 --> 00:23:04.796
After the battle was over, they
sealed themselves into a long sleep.

00:23:04.796 --> 00:23:07.799
With Jurai facing a crisis,
those two are resurrected

00:23:07.799 --> 00:23:13.638
to fight again alongside
the current king of Jurai.

00:23:13.638 --> 00:23:15.974
Their names are...

00:23:15.974 --> 00:23:18.042
Next episode is: "No Need for Knights!"

00:23:18.042 --> 00:23:20.636
It's unquestionably rejuvenating.
